WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.640
Ko si ti?

2
00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:02.340
Šuti! Ovo je pljačka!

3
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.800
Aha, dobrodošao u najgori stan za to.

4
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:05.660
Daj pare!

5
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.060
Brate, ja sam jutros pogledala stanje na računu

6
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.400
i izvinila se aplikaciji.

7
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:10.520
Nemaš ništa?

8
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.340
Imam stres, dugove i pola pavlake u frižideru.

9
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:14.420
Gdje ti je nakit?

10
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.600
Na slikama iz 2019.

11
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:16.640
Laptop?

12
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.520
Stariji od moje zadnje veze.

13
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.540
Radi samo kad ga zamoliš.

14
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.320
Televizor?

15
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.100
Uzmi ako hoćeš, ali daljinski ne radi.

16
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.120
Moraš ustajati kao u devedesetim.

17
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.080
Dobro, imaš li bar keša?

18
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.480
Imam dvije marke.

19
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:27.820
Samo dvije?

20
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.760
I jednu kovanicu iz Hrvatske,

21
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.920
ali ni tamo više ne vrijedi.

22
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.700
Pa šta ti radiš u životu?

23
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.000
Preživljavam. Ti?

24
00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.300
Isto, izgleda.

25
00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.320
Hoćeš čaj?

26
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:37.940
Ja sam došao da kradem.

27
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:40.620
Znam, ali vidiš da nema materijala.

28
00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:42.820
Ovo mi je najgora pljačka u karijeri.

29
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.460
Meni je najgori mjesec u godini, pa ne kukam.

30
00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.280
Čekaj, ti si stvarno švorc?

31
00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.560
Jesam. Ako si došao po pare,

32
00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.080
sjedni da zajedno čekamo platu.

33
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:51.800
Kad liježe?

34
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.340
Ako Bog da, u petak.

35
00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:54.260
A danas?

36
00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:55.240
Ponedjeljak.

37
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.460
Dobro, ja idem.

38
00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:57.060
Čekaj.

39
00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:57.780
Šta je?

40
00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.940
Kad već izlaziš, možeš li iznijeti smeće?

41
00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:01.240
Jesi ti normalna?

42
00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.280
Brate, već si mi ušao u stan.

43
00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:04.140
Bar budi koristan.
